# 📖 Revision Cheat Sheet

| Concept               | Key Point                                                                                               |
| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Symmetric Encryption  | One shared secret key                                                                                   |
| Asymmetric Encryption | Public key + Private key                                                                                |
| AES                   | Fast, modern symmetric encryption                                                                       |
| DES                   | Outdated and insecure                                                                                   |
| 3DES                  | Legacy improvement over DES, mostly retired                                                             |
| RSA                   | Asymmetric algorithm for secure key exchange and authentication                                         |
| Diffie-Hellman        | Secure key exchange                                                                                     |
| HTTPS                 | Uses asymmetric cryptography to establish a secure session, then symmetric encryption for data transfer |

